"id": 26639,
"Key": "PlayStationActivityHintDenOfEvilHeader",
"enUS": "Focus the Fallen Shamans"
},
{
"id": 26640,
"Key": "PlayStationActivityHintDenOfEvilDescription",
"enUS": "If left alone, Fallen Shamans will resurrect their fellow Fallen."
},
{
"id": 26641,
"Key": "PlayStationActivityHintSistersBurialGroundHeader",
"enUS": "Slow Blood Raven"
},
{
"id": 26642,
"Key": "PlayStationActivityHintSistersBurialGroundDescription",
"enUS": "Cold damage can help slow Blood Raven making her easier to hit."
},
{
"id": 26643,
"Key": "PlayStationActivityHintSearchForCainHeader",
"enUS": "Find the Cairn Stones"
},
{
"id": 26644,
"Key": "PlayStationActivityHintSearchForCainDescription",
"enUS": "Once Akara deciphers the Scroll of Inifuss, you will need to find the Cairn Stones in the Stony Fields. Make sure that you have the waypoint to get there quickly."
},
{
"id": 26645,
"Key": "PlayStationActivityHintTheForgottenTowerHeader",
"enUS": "Beware the Countess' fire"
},
{
"id": 26646,
"Key": "PlayStationActivityHintTheForgottenTowerDescription",
"enUS": "The Countess is Fire Enchanted so not only do her attacks deal fire damage, but her corpse will explode when she dies."
},
{
"id": 26647,
"Key": "PlayStationActivityHintSistersToTheSlaughterHeader",
"enUS": "Boost poison resistance"
},
{
"id": 26648,
"Key": "PlayStationActivityHintSistersToTheSlaughterDescription",
"enUS": "Andariel can deal large amounts of poison damage. Be sure to have poison resistance or Antidote Potions to aid in the fight."
},
{
"id": 26649,
"Key": "PlayStationActivityHintRadamentsLairHeader",
"enUS": "Deny Radament corpses"
},
{
"id": 26650,
"Key": "PlayStationActivityHintRadamentsLairDescription",
"enUS": "Freezing enemies will cause them to shatter on death, leaving no corpse for Radament to raise. Alternatively, make use of the corpses before Radament can!"
},
{
"id": 26651,
"Key": "PlayStationActivityHintTheSummonerHeader",
"enUS": "Protect against cold"
},
{
"id": 26652,
"Key": "PlayStationActivityHintTheSummonerDescription",
"enUS": "Cold resist can make the Summoner's attacks less lethal."
},
{
"id": 26653,
"Key": "PlayStationActivityHintTheSevenTombsHeader",
"enUS": "Portal away if necessary"
},
{
"id": 26654,
"Key": "PlayStationActivityHintTheSevenTombsDescription",
"enUS": "Town Portals can be created mid battle, allowing you to return to town to restock on potions if necessary."
},
{
"id": 26655,
"Key": "PlayStationActivityHintTheGoldenBirdHeader",
"enUS": "Hunt a unique monster"
},
{
"id": 26656,
"Key": "PlayStationActivityHintTheGoldenBirdDescription",
"enUS": "The Jade Figurine is dropped from the first unique monster you encounter after leaving the Kurast Docks."
},
{
"id": 26657,
"Key": "PlayStationActivityHintTheBlackenedTempleHeader",
"enUS": "Divide and conquer"
},
{
"id": 26658,
"Key": "PlayStationActivityHintTheBlackenedTempleDescription",
"enUS": "Members of the High Council can be lured away making for easier fights."
},
{
"id": 26659,
"Key": "PlayStationActivityHintTheGuardianHeader",
"enUS": "Up close and personal"
},
{
"id": 26660,
"Key": "PlayStationActivityHintTheGuardianDescription",
"enUS": "Mephisto excels at range so keeping him close can help mitigate his damage."
},
{
"id": 26661,
"Key": "PlayStationActivityHintFallenAngelHeader",
"enUS": "Boost cold resistance"
},
{
"id": 26662,
"Key": "PlayStationActivityHintFallenAngelDescription",
"enUS": "Izual has cold attacks. Be sure to have cold resistance or Thawing Potions to aid in the fight."
},
{
"id": 26663,
"Key": "PlayStationActivityHintHellsForgeHeader",
"enUS": "Isolate Hephasto"
},
{
"id": 26664,
"Key": "PlayStationActivityHintHellsForgeDescription",
"enUS": "Hephasto can be lured away from his forge so that he is alone."
},
{
"id": 26665,
"Key": "PlayStationActivityHintTerrorsEndHeader",
"enUS": "Be cautious with portal placement"
},
{
"id": 26666,
"Key": "PlayStationActivityHintTerrorsEndDescription",
"enUS": "If you need to retreat from the fight, then make sure that your Town Portal is out of Diablo's vision or he might cast Bone Prison on them."
},
{
"id": 26667,
"Key": "PlayStationActivityHintSiegeOfHarrogathHeader",
"enUS": "Focus the Overseers"
},
{
"id": 26668,
"Key": "PlayStationActivityHintSiegeOfHarrogathDescription",
"enUS": "Overseers can cause minions to go into a frenzy, making them charge you and explode."
},
{
"id": 26669,
"Key": "PlayStationActivityHintRiteOfPassageHeader",
"enUS": "Focus Madawc"
},
{
"id": 26670,
"Key": "PlayStationActivityHintRiteOfPassageDescription",
"enUS": "Madawc’s double throw can stun you long enough for the others to land fatal blows. Try targeting him first."
},
